{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42813","headline":"登郡楼书怀 三 · 刘兼","name":"登郡楼书怀 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"莫嗔阮氏哭途穷，万代深沈恨亦同。\n瑞玉岂知将抵鹊，铅刀何事却屠龙。\n九夷欲适嗟吾道，五柳终归效古风。\n独倚郡楼无限意，满江烟雨正冥蒙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42813.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42813","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}